notes.body:
Hi @lindnerp & @BrianSipos, Coverity turned up the following:

```
*** CID 1515948:  Null pointer dereferences  (FORWARD_NULL)
/builds/wireshark/wireshark/epan/dissectors/packet-ltp.c: 1665 in ltp_stats_tree_packet()
1659     	case 0x8: // report
1660     	case 0xd:
1661     	case 0xe: // cancel from receiver
1662     		eng_addr = &(pinfo->dst);
1663     		break;
1664     	}
>>>     CID 1515948:  Null pointer dereferences  (FORWARD_NULL)
>>>     Passing null pointer "eng_addr" to "address_to_display", which dereferences it.
1665     	const gchar *eng_addr_str = address_to_display(wmem_packet_scope(), eng_addr);
1666     	if (eng_addr_str)
1667     	{
1668     		tick_stat_node(st, eng_addr_str, st_eng_id, FALSE);
1669     	}
1670     
```

Can you take a look?

